{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bad0edc4-f937-8876-9dd0-0d4a3268290c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-15T13:16:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Erin Donovan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:12:43-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:12:47-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi hon, Erin Donovan here. Listen, the trash truck busted my bin this morning, the recycling one, the big blue one. The lid's snapped right off the hinge and there's a crack down the side. How do I get a replacement?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:13:08-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Okay, we can put in a request for you. Was it the trash truck or the recycling truck that did it, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:13:23-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recycling, I think. It was out at the curb and they came by around eight. I found it on its side in the street, half the stuff blown down the block. I'm not mad, it happens, I just need a new one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:13:44-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Let me grab some details. What's the address where it was picked up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:13:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "320 Coggeshall Avenue, up on the Hill. It's a two-family, I'm the landlord, so the bin's shared with my tenants upstairs."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:14:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 320 Coggeshall. And the name is Erin Donovan, D-O-N-O-V-A-N?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:14:09-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:14:12-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And is the bin still usable at all, or is it done?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:14:19-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's done. I taped the lid down but it's not gonna hold. Next collection it'll just fly open."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:14:29-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'll note it as damaged by the truck so it goes in as a replacement and not a new-bin request. Do you want to leave the old one at the curb?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:14:46-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Should I? Or do I hang onto it till the new one comes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:14:53-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Keep it by the house for now. When they drop the new one, they'll take the broken one or tell you to put it out. Either way, you won't be charged when the truck did the damage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:15:12-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Now, how long does that usually take? Because I'm heading out of town, I'm planning a trip to see my cousins in Georgia, and I'd like it sorted before I go. My tenants can handle it but you know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:15:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Typically it's a few days to a week or so, depending on how many requests are ahead of yours. When do you leave?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:15:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not till the end of next month. So plenty of time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:15:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, then you're fine. It'll be here way before that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:15:57-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Do you need a number in case they have to reach me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:16:04-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, what's the best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:16:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0196. That's my cell."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:16:11-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 401-555-0196. I've got it all down. Anything else I can do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:16:19-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nope, that's all. Thanks, Denise, appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:16:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Erin. Have a good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-15T13:16:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, hon. Bye now."
    }
  ],
